*   **cabin\_noise\_rating**: Rated 0.20. While some road/wind noise is present (Source 2, 13, 17, 21, 22, 28), it is considered reasonably refined for a van (Source 13, 15, 27, 30, 31), placing it slightly above average compared to the entire market range.
*   **shift\_smooth\_rating**: Rated 0.40. The available 7-speed DSG transmission is generally smooth (Source 2, 7, 12, 15, 17, 29, 33, 36). The manual is also described as smooth (Source 7).
*   **steering\_feel\_rating**: Rated 0.50. The electro-mechanical steering provides good feel and precision for a van (Source 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 11, 12, 15, 16, 18, 19, 25, 29, 30, 31, 36).
*   **adas\_score**: Rated 0.40. Assuming a mid-range trim (like Trendline or Commerce Plus), standard ADAS includes Front Assist with City Emergency Braking, Driver Alert, Brake Assist, and Crosswind Assist (Source 4, 5, 7, 8, 12, 13, 14, 16, 20, 23, 25, 27, 32, 36, 37, 38). Higher trims add ACC, parking sensors, etc. (Source 3, 5, 7, 8, 12, 13, 14, 16, 17, 19, 20, 21, 23, 24, 25, 27, 33, 34, 36, 37, 38). This places a mid-range TDI above vehicles with minimal tech but below those with the full suite.
