*   **infotainment\_ux\_rating**: Rated 0.20. Volkswagen's infotainment system is generally considered user-friendly (Source 4, 6, 7, 10, 12, 14, 15, 19, 22, 27), but the base/mid systems are less advanced than higher trims.
