*   **comfort\_feature\_score**: Rated -0.20. Mid-range trims add some comfort features like a driver's armrest and comfort pack (Source 3, 18), but features like air conditioning are often optional on lower/mid trims (Source 2, 12, 14, 17, 27), keeping the overall comfort score below average passenger cars. Heated seats are standard on Commerce Pro and optional on others (Source 11, 17, 23, 27).
*   **convenience\_feature\_score**: Rated -0.10. Mid-range trims add rear parking sensors and cruise control over base models (Source 3, 10, 17, 25). Still lacks many features standard on higher trims (e.g., automatic lights/wipers, heated windscreen, folding mirrors, reversing camera) (Source 3, 5, 14, 16, 17, 19, 21, 23, 24, 27, 33, 36, 38).
