*   **model\_prestige\_rating**: Rated 0.80. The Transporter is a workhorse model within the VW range, highly regarded for its utility and reliability but not a high-prestige passenger vehicle. It scores high on the guide's scale for entry-level/utility models.
*   **trim\_prestige\_rating**: Rated 0.00. Assuming a mid-range trim like Trendline or Commerce Plus, which sits above the base (Startline/Commerce) and below the top (Highline/Sportline/Commerce Pro) (Source 14, 17, 23, 27, 28, 32, 36). This positions it as a "Good Trim".
*   **interior\_luxury\_rating**: Rated -0.50. The interior is focused on durability and functionality with hard-wearing materials, typical of a commercial vehicle (Source 4, 6, 17, 18, 28, 29, 33). Luxury is not a focus, especially in lower/mid trims.
*   **interior\_tech\_focus\_rating**: Rated 0.20. While it includes a touchscreen and App-Connect, mid-range TDI models lack the optional Digital Cockpit and more advanced infotainment/ADAS features available on higher trims (Source 8, 12, 13, 14, 17, 23, 27, 32, 33, 36, 37). This places its tech focus around or slightly below average compared to modern passenger cars.